---
layout: layouts/base.njk
description: "A lightweight shorthand notation that captures the essential game elements while leaving room for narrative."
---

<!-- HERO -->
<section class="pt-20 pb-16 text-center">
    <div class="max-w-site mx-auto px-6">
        <span class="block font-mono text-[0.6875rem] tracking-[0.1em] uppercase text-accent mb-5">
            Open Specification
        </span>
        <h1 class="font-display font-black text-ink leading-none tracking-tighter mb-5"
            style="font-size: clamp(3.75rem, 12vw, 6rem)">{{ site.title }}</h1>
        <p class="font-display font-medium text-[0.9375rem] text-muted tracking-[0.015em] mb-2">
            {{ site.description }}
        </p>
        <span class="inline-block font-mono text-[0.6875rem] text-muted border border-wire
                     px-3 py-[0.18em] rounded-sm mb-11">v{{ site.version }}</span>
        <p class="max-w-xl mx-auto text-[1.0625rem] leading-[1.8] mb-10">
            A lightweight shorthand language designed to separate mechanics from fiction,
            stay compact at the table, and scale seamlessly from quick one-shots
            to sprawling campaigns.
        </p>
        <div class="flex justify-center flex-wrap gap-2 mb-16">
            <a href="{{ site.docs }}" class="btn-primary">Read the Docs</a>
            <a href="{{ site.itch }}" class="btn-outline">Download on Itch.io</a>
            <a href="{{ site.github }}" class="btn-ghost">GitHub</a>
        </div>
        <div class="border-t border-wire pt-10">
            <img src="/banner.png"
                 alt="The five core Lonelog symbols: @ ? d: -> =>"
                 class="hero-banner mx-auto max-w-[480px] w-full opacity-[0.88]">
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<main>

    <!-- QUICK START -->
    <section class="border-t border-wire py-16">
        <div class="max-w-site mx-auto px-6">
            <span class="section-label">Quick Start</span>
            <div class="code-block">
                <div class="code-tab">
                    <span class="code-tab-dot"></span>
                    <span class="code-tab-name">session-log.md</span>
                </div>
                <pre><code><span class="t-h">### S1</span> <span class="t-em">Dark alley, midnight</span>
<span class="t-k">@</span>  Sneak past the guard
<span class="t-k">d:</span> Stealth 4 vs TN 5 <span class="t-a">-&gt;</span> Fail
<span class="t-k">=&gt;</span> I kick a bottle. Guard turns!
<span class="t-k">?</span>  Does he see me clearly?
   <span class="t-a">-&gt;</span> No, but&hellip;
<span class="t-k">=&gt;</span> He&apos;s suspicious, starts walking toward the noise</code></pre>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CORE PHILOSOPHY -->
    <section class="border-t border-wire py-16">
        <div class="max-w-site mx-auto px-6">
            <span class="section-label">Core Philosophy</span>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 border border-wire rounded-sm overflow-hidden">
                <div class="bg-wash p-6 border-b sm:border-b-0 sm:border-r border-wire">
                    <span class="block font-mono text-lg font-semibold text-accent mb-3.5">@</span>
                    <p class="font-display font-semibold text-[0.9375rem] mb-1.5">Format-agnostic</p>
                    <p class="font-serif text-[0.9rem] leading-[1.7] text-muted">
                        Works identically in digital Markdown code blocks or analog paper notebooks.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="bg-wash p-6 border-b sm:border-b-0 sm:border-r border-wire">
                    <span class="block font-mono text-lg font-semibold text-accent mb-3.5">d:</span>
                    <p class="font-display font-semibold text-[0.9375rem] mb-1.5">Toolbox, not a rulebook</p>
                    <p class="font-serif text-[0.9rem] leading-[1.7] text-muted">
                        Fully modular. Use the five core symbols or layer in Clocks, Threads, and NPC tags as needed.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="bg-wash p-6">
                    <span class="block font-mono text-lg font-semibold text-accent mb-3.5">&#x2192;</span>
                    <p class="font-display font-semibold text-[0.9375rem] mb-1.5">Built for scannability</p>
                    <p class="font-serif text-[0.9rem] leading-[1.7] text-muted">
                        Standardised tokens let external tools, plugins, and human readers parse logs at a glance.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- RECENT POSTS (only rendered when posts exist) -->
    {% if collections.posts and collections.posts.length %}
    <section class="border-t border-wire py-16">
        <div class="max-w-site mx-auto px-6">
            <span class="section-label">Latest from the Blog</span>
            <ul class="divide-y divide-wire border-t border-wire">
                {% for post in collections.posts | limit(3) %}
                <li class="py-6">
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-1.5">
                        <time class="font-mono text-xs text-muted" datetime="{{ post.date | dateISO }}">
                            {{ post.date | dateDisplay }}
                        </time>
                        {% if post.data.category %}
                        <span class="badge badge-{{ post.data.category }}">{{ post.data.category | categoryLabel }}</span>
                        {% endif %}
                    </div>
                    <p class="font-display font-bold text-[1.125rem] tracking-tight mb-1.5">
                        <a href="{{ post.url }}" class="hover:text-accent transition-colors">{{ post.data.title }}</a>
                    </p>
                    {% if post.data.description %}
                    <p class="font-serif text-[0.9375rem] text-muted leading-[1.65]">{{ post.data.description }}</p>
                    {% endif %}
                </li>
                {% endfor %}
            </ul>
            <div class="mt-6">
                <a href="/blog/" class="btn-ghost">All posts &rarr;</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
    {% endif %}

    <!-- COMMUNITY -->
    <section class="border-t border-wire py-16">
        <div class="max-w-site mx-auto px-6">
            <span class="section-label">Community</span>
            <p class="font-display font-bold text-[1.25rem] tracking-tight mb-5">Join the conversation</p>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                <a href="{{ site.reddit }}" class="btn-ghost">Reddit</a>
                <a href="{{ site.discord }}" class="btn-ghost">Discord</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

</main>
